    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae8a7f8131d59997ffd30ebf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以说是……羁绊吧。这会化作力量、成为支撑。\n我希望大家在体验合宿中，能够感受到这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc16d0cfee75703212d07a6588a6bbee0086f69d9ed049a60cd795ef91e77342",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0306/storytimeline_830306003.json",
