      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:667dd4429a2fe3c10ec4b3dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，她提出了『1晚体验合宿』的企划。\n在合宿所住上两天一夜，\n让报考的考生体验学园生活。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12fb11079a613d80afb764946ea03016551f6e26f385b3e94994069026bbc097",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
