      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9930760e8400ef86fe50c448",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质所展现出的希望。\n未来的学妹们凝视着这道光，\n眼中充满了期待——",
      "source_fingerprint": "b452492bc1e971a8d38dfee298228fe464dc20b53c99cbfd79e3cd90436f6bd3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0306/storytimeline_830306003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c75587447ece98462d3d80cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为有商量过这事的缘故，\n我也接下了领队的工作。\n然后，一起参加这次体验合宿的还有——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6281b1d99120cc1fe191c4bfc7d6453353679ae4717a55f77e5bb9d56d121b1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0306/storytimeline_830306003.json",
